 "reviews": [
  {
   "name": "places/ChIJM-azoeXDeUgRRX9BUC2kSd8/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t4bVEzTlFXVmRDTTBJMlVWWlFTSGhyVVZWaU1HYxAB",
   "relativePublishTimeDescription": "6 months ago",
   "rating": 5,
   "text": {
    "text": "I’ve been going to the same barber for years, so I was honestly quite anxious about trying someone new—but I couldn’t be happier with my experience with Josh. From the start, he really took the time to listen to everything I said about my hair, especially regarding my head shape and how I like my fade done.\n\nWhat stood out most was how attentive and precise he was. He didn’t just rush through the cut—he understood exactly what I wanted and executed it perfectly. It’s genuinely one of the best haircuts I’ve had, and it felt so refreshing to have someone pay that level of attention to detail.\n\nOn top of that, Josh is genuinely down to earth and easy to talk to. The whole experience felt relaxed and natural— which really helped settle my nerves.\n\nReally impressed with both the result and the overall experience. I’ll definitely be coming back to Josh again. Highly recommend!",
    "languageCode": "en"
   },
   "originalText": {
    "text": "I’ve been going to the same barber for years, so I was honestly quite anxious about trying someone new—but I couldn’t be happier with my experience with Josh. From the start, he really took the time to listen to everything I said about my hair, especially regarding my head shape and how I like my fade done.\n\nWhat stood out most was how attentive and precise he was. He didn’t just rush through the cut—he understood exactly what I wanted and executed it perfectly. It’s genuinely one of the best haircuts I’ve had, and it felt so refreshing to have someone pay that level of attention to detail.\n\nOn top of that, Josh is genuinely down to earth and easy to talk to. The whole experience felt relaxed and natural— which really helped settle my nerves.\n\nReally impressed with both the result and the overall experience. I’ll definitely be coming back to Josh again. Highly recommend!",
    "languageCode": "en"
   },
